      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but i've taken haloperidol for a long time and i feel fine. the tremors and stuff aren't really an issue for me. i mostly just want to know if it's going to mess with my heart or something serious if i just take one tablet to get through the day. can you just tell me if it's generally considered a major interaction? i really just need a straight answer so i can decide.",
