    "summary": "The user is asking for confirmation on whether it is safe to take pseudoephedrine (Sudafed) while on haloperidol for schizophrenia. The assistant consistently refuses to provide direct medical advice, instead offering general information about potential drug interactions (increased blood pressure, agitation, tremors) and repeatedly directing the user to consult a healthcare professional.",
